<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.4.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00420</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.4.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>58fc5db6-34f4-4182-b178-21f103659d27</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para><b><emphasis effect="italics">Students will complete the following questions to
  practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></b></para>
<para>For 1 - 8, solve the systems of equations
  using the elimination method.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}5x\;+\;2y\;=\;2\\-6x\;-\;2y\;=\;0\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((-3,9)\)</item>
  <item>\((0,1)\)</item>
  <item>\((2,-4)\)</item>
  <item>\((-2,6)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = -2 \), \( y = 6 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}2x\;-\;5y\;=\;7\\-15x\;+\;5y\;=\;-85\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((7,4)\)</item>
  <item>\((5,-2)\)</item>
  <item>\((6,1)\)</item>
  <item>\((-4,-3)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = 6 \), \( y = 1 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}6x\;-\;10y\;=\;-18\\25x\;+\;10y\;=\;80\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((2,3)\)</item>
  <item>\((7,6)\)</item>
  <item>\((0,8)\)</item>
  <item>\((4,-2)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = 2 \), \( y = 3 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}-6x\;-\;16y\;=\;6\\6x\;+\;15y\;=\;-9\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((-14,5)\)</item>
  <item>\((-9,3)\)</item>
  <item>\((1,-1)\)</item>
  <item>\((7,-2)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = -9 \), \( y = 3 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}-15x\;-\;40y\;=\;-335\\15x\;+\;9y\;=\;180\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((12,0)\)</item>
  <item>\((9,5)\)</item>
  <item>\((17,2)\)</item>
  <item>\((6,10)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = 9 \), \( y = 5 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}x\;-\;3y\;=\;-9\\x\;+\;\frac52y\;=\;2\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((-3,2)\)</item>
  <item>\((0,3)\)</item>
  <item>\((2,0)\)</item>
  <item>\((-9,0)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = -3 \), \( y = 2 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}x\;+\;\frac13y\;=\;3\\2x\;+\;\frac13y\;=\;5\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((3,0)\)</item>
  <item>\((0,9)\)</item>
  <item>\((0,15)\)</item>
  <item>\((2,3)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = 2 \), \( y = 3 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}3x\;-\;8y\;=\;-35\\-5x\;+\;8y\;=\;45\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((-9,0)\)</item>
  <item>\((7,7)\)</item>
  <item>\((-5,2.5)\)</item>
  <item>\((-1,4)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( x = -5 \), \( y = 2.5 \)
</para>
<para>For 9 - 10,
  add the equations in the following systems of equations. What is the resulting
  new equation?</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}4x\;-\;6y\;=\;14\\-4x\;+\;y\;=\;-19\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( -5y=-5 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item> \(\begin{array}{c}\left\{\begin{array}{l}3x\;-\;5y\;=\;18\\7x\;+\;5y\;=\;-8\end{array}\right.\\\\\end{array}\)</item>
</list>
<para><b>Answer: </b>\( 10x=10 \)</para>
</section>
</content>
</document>
